<Layout title="Run Lancer locally" description="Start Lancer Harness from a local source checkout.">
  <h1>Run Lancer locally</h1>
  <p>Install <a href="https://viteplus.dev/guide/">Vite+</a>. In the root of your Lancer Harness checkout, run</p>
  <pre><code>vp i
vp run dev</code></pre>
  <p>Open the local URL printed by the launcher. For the desktop app, run <code>vp run dev:desktop</code>.</p>
  <h2>Try the included case</h2>
  <p>Open <code>examples/product-claims-review/README.md</code> in the checkout for the fictional product records, assignment and offline checker.</p>
</Layout>
